<Layout title="Where to read studio reviews" description="Find Legacy Music Group on Google Maps to read current reviews and check the business listing. This website does not claim a rating or republish unverified testimonials."><div class="shell"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Legacy Music Group</p><h1>Hear from<br /><em>other artists.</em></h1></header><article class="reading"><h2>Read the current listing</h2><p>Use Legacy’s Google Maps listing to read current reviews, see their dates and decide what matters for your project. This website does not state an aggregate score or a review count.</p><h2>Ask about your session</h2><p>Reviews can describe past experiences. For the people, room, equipment or service you need now, ask the studio directly and check the current booking calendar.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href={business.mapsUrl}>Find Legacy on Google Maps ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Talk about your project</a></div></article></div></Layout>
